          "event": "Beach Hazards Statement",
          "headline": "Beach Hazards Statement issued September 7 at 7:58AM PDT until September 7 at 11:00PM PDT by NWS San Francisco CA",
          "severity": "Moderate",
          "urgency": "Expected",
          "description": "* WHAT...Increased risk of sneaker waves and strong rip currents\ndue to incoming long period southerly swell associated with\ntropical activity in the Eastern Pacific Ocean. Breaking waves\nto around 10 feet expected.\n\n* WHERE...Pacific Coast beaches.\n\n* WHEN...Through 11 PM PDT Monday evening.\n\n* IMPACTS...Dangerous conditions are forecast along the shoreline.\nHazards include sneaker waves, strong rip currents, and large\nbreaking waves.",
